  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Immediate technical assistance to strengthen emergency preparedness for Highly Pathogenic Avian Influenza (HPAI) ( Grant GHA-A-00-06-00001 )</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to address the urgent short-term actions that are to be undertaken by the countries in the region to strengthen its capacity in order to rapidly detect the introduction of HPAI into the country and minimize its spread in the case of its occurrence. Achieving this goal will significantly reduce the threat of pandemic influenza and help safeguard the livelihoods of the rural and peri-urban population.</narrative>
  </description>
